    "仅在你点击授权后读取；联系人保存在本机/iCloud，不会上传。你随时可在系统设置中关闭。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contacts are read only after you allow access and stay on this device/iCloud; they are never uploaded. You can turn this off anytime in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
