    "只从本机隐藏这些对话；原始短信和其他设备不受影响，重新收到消息会再次出现。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These conversations are hidden on this device only; raw messages and other devices are unaffected and a new message will show it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只从本机隐藏这些对话；原始短信和其他设备不受影响，重新收到消息会再次出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅從本機隱藏這些對話；原始簡訊和其他裝置不受影響，再次收到訊息時會重新出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会导入勾选的联系人；不会删除或覆盖现有内容。建议先导出备份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only checked contacts are imported; nothing existing is deleted or overwritten. Export a backup first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会导入勾选的联系人；不会删除或覆盖现有内容。建议先导出备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只會匯入勾選的聯絡人；不會刪除或覆蓋現有內容。建議先匯出備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
